          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia ni suti nikukase, nichakukasa na iro maza ra wunyonge ghwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo Mlungu, na Ndee wa Bwana Jesu, uo ukaswagha kwa kala na kala, wamanya angu siwueghora tee kungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aja Dameshki, m'baa uko aisi ya mzuri Areta, orewikieghe masikari ghelindia muzi ghwa Dameshki eri wipate kuniwada;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
